{"id":"9122b5c88378bf5b","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-club-derivative.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Club Derivative","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-club-derivative — ZFC Ordinal8 Club Derivative","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-club-derivative","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-club-derivative"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-club-derivative — ZFC Ordinal8 Club Derivative","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-club-derivative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-club-derivative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-club-derivative — ZFC Ordinal8 Club Derivative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,C,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(D,C,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ClubDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ClubDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}club\\text{-}derivative} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ClubDerivative}_S(D,C,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\lambda)\\land\nD=\\{\\alpha\\in\\lambda:\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\bigcup(C\\cap\\alpha)=\\alpha\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}club\\text{-}derivative} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ClubDerivative}_S(D,C,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\lambda)\\land\nD=\\{\\alpha\\in\\lambda:\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\bigcup(C\\cap\\alpha)=\\alpha\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The derivative uses the exact upstream limit-ordinal predicate; membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> follows from club closedness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordina